    "body": "Fixes #42317.\n\nProblem: `<C-Y>` and mouse wheel scrolling loop when the line below `conceal_lines` has `virt_lines_above`. `scrolldown()` moves `w_topline` onto the concealed lines before that line's filler lines are shown, so they appear without being counted and `update_topline()` scrolls back down.\n\nSolution: Only move `w_topline` onto the concealed lines once all its filler lines are shown.\n\nThis also fixes the `virt_lines_above` variant in #42077, but not its main layout. Known limitation: with `concealcursor=n`, `curs_rows()` can miscount the row of a concealed cursor line, and one dense-layout case (`scrolloff=8`, 10-line window) that worked on master now bounces.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-22T02:40:28Z",
